### Python Agent 健康检查
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### Java Actuator 健康检查
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### Java 业务服务信息
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/system/info
Accept: application/json

### 查询当前用户自己的订单：200
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/orders/A1001
X-Tenant-Id: company_001
X-User-Id: U1001
Accept: application/json

### 查询不存在的订单：404
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/orders/UNKNOWN
X-Tenant-Id: company_001
X-User-Id: U1001
Accept: application/json

### 查询其他用户的订单：404，不能泄露订单是否存在
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/orders/A1001
X-Tenant-Id: company_001
X-User-Id: U9999
Accept: application/json

### 通过 Java 创建 Agent 会话：201
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/agent/threads
X-Tenant-Id: company_001
X-User-Id: U1001
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.global.set("thread_id", response.body.thread_id);
%}

### 通过 Java 演示多租户 RAG 与结构化来源
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/agent/chat/stream
X-Tenant-Id: company_001
X-User-Id: U1001
Accept: text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thread_id": "{{thread_id}}",
  "message": "已经拆封的软件支持七天无理由退货吗？"
}

### 通过 Java 接收 Agent SSE
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/agent/chat/stream
X-Tenant-Id: company_001
X-User-Id: U1001
Accept: text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "thread_id": "{{thread_id}}",
  "message": "请帮我申请订单 A1001 的退款"
}

### 拒绝退款并从原 LangGraph Checkpoint 恢复（可重复演示）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/agent/threads/{{thread_id}}/resume
X-Tenant-Id: company_001
X-User-Id: U1001
Idempotency-Key: refund-demo-001
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved": false
}
